      381.73
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends subsection (1) of section 6 of the Chemical Weapons Convention Act, No. 58 of 2007 and the legal effect of that section as amended is to change the portfolio of the Minister who shall be charged with the implementation of this Act.",
