      253.71
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CHEMICAL WEAPONS CONVENTION ACT, NO. 58 OF 2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      159.5,
      268.37,
      402.04,
      292.71
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      160.5,
      307.37,
      402.03,
      331.71
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Chemical Weapons Convention (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      160.5,
      346.37,
      402.03,
      409.71
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 6 of the Chemical Weapons Convention Act, No. 58 of 2007 is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereof by the substitution for the words \u201cMinister in charge of the subject of Industries\u201d of the words \u201cMinister assigned the subject of Defence\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      160.5,
      422.37,
      402.03,
      445.71
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
